---
/**
 * Privacy policy. Written to match what the site actually does — see
 * worker/contact.js (form delivery), worker/gbp.js (Google Business Profile)
 * and CoverageMap (OpenStreetMap tiles). If any of those change, update this.
 * The Google API section is required for the OAuth consent screen.
 */
import LegalPage from '@/components/LegalPage.astro';
import { business } from '@/data/business';
const updated = 'October 4, 2026';
---
<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" path="privacy" updated={updated}
  description="How Nico & Vito Locksmith handles the information you give us through this website, by phone or by text.">

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This website, nicovitolocksmith.com, is run by {business.legalName} ("Nico &amp; Vito", "we", "us"),
    a mobile locksmith serving Brooklyn and Staten Island, New York. If you have a question about this
    policy, email <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> or call {business.phoneDisplay}.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p><strong>When you send the quote form</strong>, we receive what you type in:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name and phone number;</li>
    <li>the service you need and your neighborhood;</li>
    <li>on the full form, optionally your email address and a description of the job.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    <strong>When you call, text or email us</strong>, we receive your phone number or email address and
    whatever you tell us about the job.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>When you visit the site</strong>, our hosting provider, Cloudflare, records standard technical
    information such as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested, to keep the site running
    and secure.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site does <strong>not</strong> use advertising trackers or analytics cookies, and it does not
    set cookies to follow you around the web.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>to call or text you back with a price and to arrange the job;</li>
    <li>to carry out the work and keep a record of it;</li>
    <li>to follow up about that job, if needed;</li>
    <li>to keep the website working and protect it from abuse.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your information, and we do not put you on a marketing list.</p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>Only with the services that make the website work, and only as much as they need:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts the website.</li>
    <li><strong>Resend</strong> delivers quote-form submissions to our email inbox, and <strong>Twilio</strong> may deliver them to our phone by text message.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>OpenStreetMap</strong>: pages with our coverage map load map images directly from
      OpenStreetMap's servers, which receive your IP address in the process.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Google</strong>: reviews and photos from our Google Business Profile, and links to Google Maps,
      come from Google. Photos load from Google's servers, which receive your IP address.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may also disclose information if the law requires it.</p>

  <h2>Google API services</h2>
  <p>
    We use the Google Business Profile APIs only to read our own business's public reviews and photos so
    we can show them on this website. We do not access, collect or store any visitor's Google account
    data. Our use of information received from Google APIs adheres to the
    <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>,
    including the Limited Use requirements.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep quote requests and job details for as long as we need them to do the work and keep normal
    business records. You can ask us to delete your information at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to see, correct or delete the information we hold about you by emailing
    <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> or calling {business.phoneDisplay}.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This website is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served only over HTTPS, and form submissions go straight to us through the providers
    above. No method of transmission is perfectly secure, but we take reasonable care with what you send.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If we change this policy, we will update it here and change the date at the top.</p>
</LegalPage>
